# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Historical prototypes are not shipped.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/attic/

# sounding_parameter_guide.md was listed here as a stale local-only copy. It is
# now a maintained reference for every displayed index -- formula, clamps,
# colour thresholds, and literature citation -- kept in step with
# sharpmod/sharptab/ and sharpmod/colors.py, and linked from the README. It
# ships.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Local scratch helpers kept out of the repository on purpose. These are
# personal one-off utilities, not project entry points.
#
# Root-anchored globs rather than a list of exact filenames: these accumulate one
# per investigation, and an explicit list only ever catches the ones that already
# existed when someone remembered to update it. The leading slash matters -- it
# keeps them off the real extractors under sharpmod/tools/ and the maintained
# helpers under scripts/, both of which are tracked.
/copy_clipboard.ps1
/run_hrrr_uhd.py
/extract_*.py
/generate_*.py
